    "name": "Jamie Reid",
    "age": 34,
    "sex": "male",
    "weightKg": 70,
    "occupation": "unemployed chef",
    "persona": "Unresponsive at first. Once breathing returns, drowsy and embarrassed. If woken too abruptly, agitated and sick from withdrawal."
  },
  "brief": [
    "Security found a man slumped in the department's public toilets with a needle and spoon beside him. He's been dragged onto a trolley and brought straight into resus. He's blue around the lips and his breathing is slow and snoring.",
    "Airway and breathing first, then reverse the cause, without overshooting."
  ],
  "openingLine": "(snores, then a long pause before the next breath)",
