        },
        {
          "target": "sign:pinpoint",
          "perPoint": 0.013,
          "group": "opioid"
        }
      ],
      "source": "Teaching model of heroin toxicity. Naloxone blocks the opioid effects without clearing the drug, so effects can return as naloxone wears off. Effect sizes are teaching parameters.",
